# Corelyx Semgrep ignore (Task #2: Semgrep SAST Pipeline Fix, Schritt 3)
# Exclude generated / vendored / test-fixtures from SAST to cut false positives.
# Keep this minimal — only ignore what is genuinely not first-party source.

# Build artifacts & generated code
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/.next/
**/generated/

# Vendored dependencies
**/vendor/

# Test fixtures that intentionally contain unsafe-looking sample payloads
**/tests/fixtures/
**/__fixtures__/
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
**/*.spec.ts

# Lockfiles & docs
**/package-lock.json
**/pnpm-lock.yaml
**/*.md
